                "Prompt #1 (case-sensitive, default):",
                "- command must match exactly: ExactCase",
                {
                    "type": "prompt",
                    "prompt": "strict> ",
                    "commands": [
                        {
                            "command": "ExactCase",
                            "action": {
                                "type": "link",
